  "description": "The shared library includes common classes for Maui applications on Android, iOS, and Windows using Google android.speech, Apple Speech, and Microsoft WindowsMedia speech recognition and speech synthesis engines.\n\nCommon classes are used across Chant products: GrammarKit, KinesicsKit, LexiconKit, ProfileKit, SpeechKit, VoiceMarkupKit, and VoiceXMLKit.\n\nDocumentation is available at https://www.chant.net/support/documentation.\n\nNOTE: This is a commercial software product and requires a purchased license for use. Evaluation credentials are available at https://www.chant.net/support/downloads. Purchased licensed credentials are available at https://www.chant.net/store. See https://www.chant.net/products/developerworkbench for more information about evaluating and purchasing licenses.",
